        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Cladun, short for \"Classic Dungeon\", is a retro-twinged sprite-based dungeon crawler for the PSP, developed by Nippon Ichi. Cladun features the ability to swap between regular and \"8-bit\" styles (both in graphics and music), and has ad hoc co-op multiplayer.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
